<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 5,700 MT were for Mexico (2,400 MT), Haiti (1,500 MT), unknown destinations (1,300 MT), and El Salvador (500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 10,100 MT were mainly to Mexico (3,800 MT), Hong Kong (3,000 MT), and Nicaragua (2,400 MT).</p>
</text>
